I left out both operations requests. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no filesystem or HTTP authority. Appending to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` and fetching from `metadata.internal.example` would each need a capability the node was never given. If operations needs them, the graph would have to grant the node a logging or HTTP capability first.

